erokee-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids had May to June at 195% of normal, then September to October at 56% and November to December at 54%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 49% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
